<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Happy Birthday Sharo 🎂</title>

<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
 margin:0;min-height:100vh;
 display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
 font-family:Arial,sans-serif;color:white;
 background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff8fbd,#8b5cf6,#25164f);
 overflow:auto;
}
.card{
 width:90%;max-width:430px;
 padding:30px 22px;
 text-align:center;
 border-radius:28px;
 background:rgba(255,255,255,.14);
 backdrop-filter:blur(15px);
 box-shadow:0 20px 60px #0006;
}
.gift{font-size:70px}
h1{font-size:42px;margin:8px 0}
.sub{font-size:16px;opacity:.9}
button{
 margin-top:25px;padding:14px 23px;
 border:0;border-radius:30px;
 font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;
 color:#7c3aed;background:white;
}
.message{
 display:none;text-align:left;
 line-height:1.65;margin-top:25px;
 font-size:15px;
}
.message.show{display:block}
.signature{text-align:center;font-weight:bold;margin-top:20px}
.heart{
 position:fixed;top:-30px;
 animation:fall 4s linear forwards;
}
@keyframes fall{
 to{transform:translateY(110vh) rotate(360deg);opacity:0}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="card">

<div class="gift">🎁</div>

<div class="sub">A little birthday surprise for</div>

<h1>Sharo 💗</h1>

<div class="sub">
My Best Friend & One of My Closest People 🫶🏻
</div>

<button onclick="openGift()">
Open Your Birthday Gift ✨
</button>

<div id="message" class="message">

<h2>🎂 Happy Birthday, Sharo! 🎀</h2>

<p>
Happy Birthday to my favourite person! ❤️✨
</p>

<p>
Pata nahi kaise, par tu meri life ke un logon mein se hai
jo mere liye bahut special ban gaye hain.
Tere saath baat karna, hasi-mazaak karna aur chhoti-chhoti
baatein share karna mere din ko better bana deta hai.
</p>

<p>
Tu sirf meri best friend nahi, balki meri close friend bhi hai,
jiske saath main bina soche apni har baat share kar sakta hoon. 🫶🏻
</p>

<p>
Bas yahi dua hai ki teri life hamesha khushiyon se bhari rahe,
tere saare dreams poore hon aur tere face par ye cute si smile
hamesha rahe. ❤️
</p>

<p>
Thank you meri life ka ek itna special part banne ke liye.
Hamari friendship hamesha aise hi bani rahe,
chahe waqt badle ya situations. ♾️
</p>

<p>
<b>Once again, Happy Birthday, Sharo! 🎂💗</b>
</p>

<p>
<i>
You deserve all the happiness in the world.
Stay blessed, stay happy, and keep smiling always. 🧿✨
</i>
</p>

<div class="signature">
— From your best friend ❤️
</div>

</div>
</div>

<script>
function openGift(){

document.getElementById("message").classList.add("show");

for(let i=0;i<35;i++){

let h=document.createElement("div");

h.className="heart";
h.innerHTML=["💗","💖","✨","🎉","🩷"][Math.floor(Math.random()*5)];

h.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";
h.style.fontSize=(16+Math.random()*20)+"px";
h.style.animationDuration=(2+Math.random()*3)+"s";

document.body.appendChild(h);

setTimeout(()=>h.remove(),5000);
}
}
</script>

</body>
</html>
